menu "Blink Configuration"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "Blink GPIO number"
        range 0 48
        default 2
        help
            GPIO number (IOxx) connected to the LED.

            Many ESP32 DevKit boards have an on-board LED on GPIO2.
            Some boards (e.g. ESP32-C3/S3 DevKits) use GPIO8 instead.

    config BLINK_PERIOD_MS
        int "Blink period in milliseconds"
        range 10 10000
        default 1000
        help
            How long the LED stays on (and off) for each blink cycle, in ms.

endmenu
